From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement the i386 port I/O functions, __p__fileinfo and the older __p__mbcasemap.

The i386 port I/O functions _inp, _inpw, _inpd, _outp, _outpw and
_outpd (msvcrt, msvcrtd, msvcr70 .. msvcr120): they run the in/out
instruction, which raises a privileged instruction exception in user
mode as on Windows. __p__fileinfo with the _fileinfo variable (msvcrt,
msvcrtd, msvcr70, msvcr71), and __p__mbcasemap in msvcrt, msvcrtd,
msvcr70 and msvcr71 as in the later CRTs.
